# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo is meant to be published (GitHub Pages serves docs/). Everything
# below is personal health data or built from it, and must never be pushed.
# Only the shell in docs/ and the sources in _build/ are safe to publish.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Everything personal lives here: the raw Zepp exports and the payload built
# from them. One line covers the lot.
data/

# A weekly export dropped in the root instead of data/ - still built, still
# never published.
w_*/

# Built from the data, so it carries all of it
dashboard.html

# Belt and braces: never publish a CSV from anywhere in here
*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not data, just noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
